+### **get\_open\_orders / cancel\_order / cancel\_all\_orders**
+
+Since 0.2.7 orders are IOC, so nothing rests in an order book any more. These three methods are kept so strategies written for 0.2.6 keep running. The only order they can ever see is a limit order you placed for **another** stock (not `bar["ShareCode"]`) that hasn't reached that stock's next tick yet.
 
